From local/codex-reload-close-before-resume Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zbai29 <zbai29@wisc.edu>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 20:26:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Close previous session before Codex reload resume

Paseo reload spawned a replacement Codex app-server and called
thread/resume while the previous process still held the exclusive
thread writer. Close and wait for the old session first. If the
replacement then fails, keep the agent visible in error and block
startTurn until a later reload succeeds.

Independent of the external-wait patches. Verified against
getpaseo/paseo v0.5.0-beta.2 (ccd991b3e). Matches getpaseo/paseo#3574.
---
